    create-branch/diff/merge-live response. A 409 branch_changed is never
    retried and never updates that cache -- rerun describe and look at it.
    --idempotency-key defaults to a fresh UUID.

    --review never defaults. The last review printed for a slug+branch is
    remembered separately, and `--review last` is the only thing that spends
